# Limits per account, movement type (TRANSFER, PURCHASE, SERVICE, WITHDRAWAL) and calendar period
# (DAILY: since midnight, WEEKLY: since Monday, MONTHLY: since the 1st). Within the period the account
# can make at most maxTransactions movements of the type adding up to maxAmount, in the account's
# currency. Reversed movements and withdrawal fees do not count. Exceeding a limit: 422 DECLINED.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api/v1/account/limit
@customerToken = PASTE_TOKEN_FROM_auth.http
@adminToken = PASTE_TOKEN_FROM_auth.http
@accountNumber = ACC-1774713408076
@limitId = 1

### Create or replace the limit of an account for a type and period (ADMIN)
PUT {{baseUrl}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountNumber": "{{accountNumber}}",
  "limitType": "TRANSFER",
  "timePeriod": "DAILY",
  "maxAmount": 20000.00,
  "maxTransactions": 10
}

### My limits (CUSTOMER_BASIC)
GET {{baseUrl}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Limits of an account (ADMIN)
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{accountNumber}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Remove a limit (ADMIN): 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/{{limitId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
